<title>USA: Argosy Gaming gets Indiana gaming license.</title>
<headline>Argosy Gaming gets Indiana gaming license.</headline>
<dateline>ALTON, Ill. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argosy Gaming Co said Thursday the Indiana Gaming Commission granted a gaming license to Indiana Gaming Co LP, the partnership in which Argosy's subsidiary holds a 57.5 percent interest and is a general partner.</p>
<p>It said the license is for a riverboat casino and entertainment complex in Lawrenceburg, Ind., near Cincinnati, Ohio.</p>
<p>The first gaming session is scheduled for December 13.</p>
<p>		  ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
